<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish NTMA to auction 150 mln punts of 10-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Irish NTMA to auction 150 mln punts of 10-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ireland's National Treasury Management Agency (NTMA) said on Monday that it would auction 150 million Irish pounds of the eight percent bond due 2006 on March 18.</p>
<p>The competitive auction will be held at 1000 GMT and will be confined to primary dealers, the NTMA said.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
